README
------

* BasicComparisons.java:           demonstrates basic if-else if-else 
                                   comparisons
 
* BasicComparisonsShort.java:      demonstrates short version of basic 
                                   if-else comparison

* BasicComparisonsLogicalAnd.java: both conditions need to be true (logical
                                   AND)

* BasicComparisonsLogicalOr.java:  one of the conditions needs to be true 
                                   (logical OR)
